Q: Google Apps Script Templated HTML Page Not Loading A: <p>Add <code>.setXFrameOptionsMode(HtmlService.XFrameOptionsMode.ALLOWALL)</code> to the return HtmlOutput statement of your doPost function. It should look as follows:</p>
<pre><code>function doPost(e) {
  Logger.log(&quot;In doPost = &quot;);
  var t = HtmlService.createTemplateFromFile('page2.html');
  t.name = e.parameter.name;
  t.comment = e.parameter.comment;
  t.screenshot = e.parameter.screenshot;
  return t.evaluate()
    .setXFrameOptionsMode(HtmlService.XFrameOptionsMode.ALLOWALL);
}
</code></pre>
